WEBVTT

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:52.458
Layfon disgraced Gahard-<i>san</i>,
my brother disciple.

00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:54.792
I know that. But...

00:00:54.792 --> 00:00:57.375
Gorneo-<i>san</i>, you're the
only person I can count on!

00:00:57.375 --> 00:00:59.583
I'm an outsider here.

00:00:59.583 --> 00:01:03.792
No one else would risk his life
to take me to the contaminoids!

00:01:03.792 --> 00:01:05.833
Cut the crap!

00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:07.250
Shante!

00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:12.083
Why should Gor have to
do that for the likes of you all?

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:14.167
You got some nerve!

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:15.583
Shante...

00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:18.708
It's no use. Even if you got that to him,

00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:20.667
he won't use a single-edged blade.

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:23.125
While at Zuellni,
he's only used double-edged blades.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:27.083
Layfon hasn't used single-edged blades?

00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:28.792
That's right.

00:01:28.792 --> 00:01:30.208
Layfon...

00:01:30.917 --> 00:01:36.000
Layfon... He really is an idiot!

00:01:37.625 --> 00:01:39.833
Out of regret, he made himself unable to do

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.583
what he'd practiced so hard to learn...

00:01:42.583 --> 00:01:46.708
Why does he do that, always thinking only of us?

00:01:50.792 --> 00:01:54.417
It's <i>our </i>fault that Layfon did those things!

00:01:54.417 --> 00:01:57.250
If you're going to hate
someone, please hate us!

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:01.125
I don't care what happens to me! Just...

00:02:01.125 --> 00:02:05.083
Please! Let me get this sword to Layfon!

00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:07.750
Please.

00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:10.833
Please!

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:13.625
Gor...

00:02:28.792 --> 00:02:33.167
"The Stirring Cities"

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.417
I hold no ill will against you.

00:02:40.417 --> 00:02:43.500
I simply want the power you possess.

00:02:45.917 --> 00:02:47.708
What do you plan to do?

00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:50.083
Oh, just hurt you a little.

00:02:50.083 --> 00:02:50.750
What?!

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:52.875
Please don't misunderstand.

00:02:52.875 --> 00:02:57.250
What I'm interested
in is the power within you.

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:59.667
That was the first time I'd seen it...

00:02:59.667 --> 00:03:02.292
The true form of a Fallen One.

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:16.333
From what I've heard,
you have to get a little rough

00:03:16.333 --> 00:03:19.333
to get a Fallen One to come on out.

00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:30.750
So you're in there after all.

00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:36.500
But that's a military artist for you.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.458
It will take more than that
for the Fallen One to come out.

00:03:39.458 --> 00:03:42.250
Oh, well. I'll just be a bit more forceful.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.792
Savalis-<i>san</i>! What are you doing?

00:03:46.792 --> 00:03:49.375
I'm going to test her strength.

00:03:49.375 --> 00:03:50.708
"Test" her?

00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:53.750
The strength of the Fallen One inside her.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.625
What's the point of keeping
all that power locked up?

00:03:57.667 --> 00:04:00.833
It's more fun to let it
free to do as it pleases.

00:04:00.833 --> 00:04:03.583
If we did that, she would die!

00:04:03.583 --> 00:04:09.458
I see. That's good thinking.
If she died, the Fallen One would be freed.

00:04:09.458 --> 00:04:12.708
Then I would draw the Fallen One into myself.

00:04:12.708 --> 00:04:18.000
I'd like to try it. Can I control
the power of a Fallen One?!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.625
Stop it!

00:04:30.708 --> 00:04:32.125
Ma'am!

00:04:38.292 --> 00:04:39.625
Ma'am!

00:04:39.625 --> 00:04:41.917
She... She's breathing.

00:04:43.458 --> 00:04:46.250
It was Her Majesty
who wanted the Fallen Ones.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:49.042
You just want to fulfill your own desires!

00:04:49.042 --> 00:04:52.875
Maybe. But I can no longer be stopped!

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.125
This? Is this it?

00:05:16.042 --> 00:05:17.792
What was that shaking just now?

00:05:17.792 --> 00:05:20.417
Hey now. I thought <i>you </i>did it.

00:05:20.417 --> 00:05:24.833
Look at that! The outside
air is being cleansed!

00:05:24.833 --> 00:05:27.042
Who has raised this barrier?

00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:30.917
Whoever it is, it's to our advantage.

00:05:30.917 --> 00:05:32.333
Let's go.

00:05:32.333 --> 00:05:34.167
You don't have to tell me twice.

00:05:40.542 --> 00:05:43.875
So this is it? <i>This </i>is it?

00:05:43.875 --> 00:05:51.125
It's incredible...
<i>Too </i>incredible! Such euphoria!

00:05:51.125 --> 00:05:54.542
It's a waste to even try expressing it in words!

00:06:00.167 --> 00:06:03.125
Shall we have a little fun, Layfon?

00:06:07.917 --> 00:06:11.333
Oh, dear. You don't have to run away.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.500
The first dose of my Fallen One power...

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.333
Here, have some!

00:06:34.875 --> 00:06:36.750
It's more power than I'd imagined!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:40.333
Come on, can't you be a bit more expressive?

00:06:40.333 --> 00:06:42.333
Show me that you're suffering!

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:49.000
I can breathe outside air...?

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.292
Savalis-<i>san</i>! Please stop this!

00:06:51.292 --> 00:06:54.625
I have no desire to fight you!

00:06:54.625 --> 00:06:57.000
Truthfully, neither do I.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:01.083
It's pointless to defeat you
when you don't even have your Blade.

00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:09.958
This stupid piece of junk...
Don't go flying out!

00:07:09.958 --> 00:07:11.917
Please go faster!

00:07:19.083 --> 00:07:20.625
Just a little farther.

00:07:20.625 --> 00:07:25.542
Gor! Why are we doing this for Layfon?
You hate him, right?

00:07:25.542 --> 00:07:30.042
I do! But Layfon fights to protect Zuellni.

00:07:30.042 --> 00:07:32.042
And he's the only one who can do so.

00:07:32.042 --> 00:07:34.500
Then let Zuellni be destroyed!

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:36.125
It must <i>not </i>be destroyed.

00:07:36.125 --> 00:07:37.458
Why not?!

00:07:37.458 --> 00:07:41.458
You asked me before, didn't you?
If Zuellni and Glendan fought,

00:07:41.458 --> 00:07:43.042
which would I choose?

00:07:43.042 --> 00:07:44.042
Yeah...

00:07:44.042 --> 00:07:45.958
I'd side with Zuellni.

00:07:45.958 --> 00:07:49.625
Because that's where <i>you </i>are, Shante.

00:07:49.625 --> 00:07:52.542
That's why I'll take this, for Layfon's sake.

00:07:52.542 --> 00:07:53.250
You understand?

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.125
--Gor! Gor, Gor, Gor, Gor!

00:07:55.125 --> 00:07:57.875
--Hey, cool it! Don't get so worked up! That hurts!
--Gor! Gor, Gor, Gor, Gor!

00:07:57.875 --> 00:07:59.000
Gor! Gor!

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.917
Don't hold on! Stop it!

00:08:00.917 --> 00:08:02.417
I'm sorry.

00:08:03.125 --> 00:08:06.125
Layfon is not in the direction
of the contaminoids.

00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:26.125
I'd like to play with you a little more,

00:08:26.125 --> 00:08:30.000
but without your Heaven's Blade,
you just don't cut it.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.458
Also, my real target is the contaminoids.
Let's go ahead and end this.

00:08:37.833 --> 00:08:40.000
Ma'am, are you alive?

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.250
Yeah... Somehow.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:45.792
Platoon leader Gorneo is on his way.
He'll be here shortly.

00:08:45.792 --> 00:08:47.625
Understood.

00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:51.125
Fon-Fon, Leerin
will arrive there shortly.

00:08:51.125 --> 00:08:52.917
Please hold out there until she does.

00:08:52.917 --> 00:08:54.917
Leerin?! It can't be!

00:08:57.625 --> 00:08:58.625
Layfon!

00:08:58.625 --> 00:08:59.625
Leerin!

00:08:59.625 --> 00:09:01.958
I've brought a dite from
my father with me!

00:09:01.958 --> 00:09:03.000
From your father?

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:07.958
It's a Saiharden blade my
father prepared, to give to you.

00:09:07.958 --> 00:09:11.417
Leerin, I... I can't accept that.

00:09:11.417 --> 00:09:15.250
Why not? My father already
forgave you a long time ago!

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:18.458
I came to Zuellni because
I wanted to tell you that...

00:09:18.458 --> 00:09:20.958
Yet I didn't give this to you.

00:09:20.958 --> 00:09:24.750
I didn't want to regret
not giving this to you sooner.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.167
That's why I came all this way.

00:09:28.375 --> 00:09:30.583
Why do you hesitate?

00:09:30.583 --> 00:09:31.750
Felli...

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:38.083
No one can live alone.
We all fight for someone, alongside someone.

00:09:38.083 --> 00:09:42.583
Doing so makes our hearts
intertwined, letting us grow stronger.

00:09:42.583 --> 00:09:45.583
I learned that from <i>you</i>, Fon-Fon.

00:09:45.583 --> 00:09:47.000
Felli...

00:09:53.583 --> 00:09:55.125
You've had your fill, yes?

00:09:55.125 --> 00:09:58.833
It's time to set my sights on loftier targets.

00:09:58.833 --> 00:10:01.292
Playtime with you is over!

00:10:16.667 --> 00:10:18.958
Saya! What is it?

00:10:31.083 --> 00:10:34.792
That goat's the same as
the one that was inside Nina.

00:10:34.792 --> 00:10:36.208
Layfon!

00:10:59.042 --> 00:11:01.667
It can't be... Why?!

00:11:16.958 --> 00:11:18.625
Layfon!

00:11:18.625 --> 00:11:19.542
Leerin!

00:11:19.542 --> 00:11:21.167
Layfon!

00:11:27.667 --> 00:11:30.292
Are you all right, Leerin?

00:11:30.292 --> 00:11:32.333
Huh? We can breathe!

00:11:32.333 --> 00:11:34.792
That's right.

00:11:34.792 --> 00:11:37.167
I'm sorry. Maybe I didn't make it in time.

00:11:37.167 --> 00:11:38.583
Here.

00:11:40.708 --> 00:11:42.833
The Saiharden crest...

00:11:45.042 --> 00:11:47.667
A red string.

00:11:47.667 --> 00:11:50.500
It's a Saiharden single-edged blade.

00:11:52.208 --> 00:11:54.792
Thank you, Leerin.

00:11:54.792 --> 00:12:00.917
I really am glad. I'm glad you're alive.

00:12:00.917 --> 00:12:02.250
Leerin...

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.667
Layfon...

00:12:13.625 --> 00:12:15.125
Restoration.

00:12:31.875 --> 00:12:34.500
Saya... You can't be!

00:13:10.375 --> 00:13:13.833
Don't worry. I'll get you out of here soon.

00:13:13.833 --> 00:13:17.958
Layfon... Fight however you like.

00:13:17.958 --> 00:13:21.250
Act the way you act. Move forward.

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:25.458
And if you fall back, fall straight back.

00:13:26.667 --> 00:13:28.500
Begone, you shits!

00:13:33.667 --> 00:13:35.292
The Regios will be gone.

00:13:35.292 --> 00:13:38.208
Ignacius's dreams shall become reality.

00:13:38.208 --> 00:13:42.500
You shall behold Dainsleif's ultimate form.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:46.417
The ties to the sleeping girl
shall soon be apparent.

00:13:55.333 --> 00:13:56.958
What's this?

00:14:02.292 --> 00:14:05.042
I skin it and skin it, but more keeps coming out.

00:14:05.042 --> 00:14:06.792
Like an onion, isn't it?

00:14:06.792 --> 00:14:09.958
Good one, Reverse. Your sense of humor rocks.

00:14:09.958 --> 00:14:11.750
Look at <i>that </i>before you crack jokes.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.375
This time they're moving quickly.

00:14:22.208 --> 00:14:24.917
You're not getting away that easily!

00:14:28.583 --> 00:14:31.625
One got away!
Can't you send more Heaven's Blades?

00:14:31.625 --> 00:14:33.667
We're still determining whether intruders remain

00:14:33.667 --> 00:14:35.292
in the Inner Palace.

00:14:35.292 --> 00:14:37.583
Hurry and let me go! Shit!

00:14:40.792 --> 00:14:43.667
That contaminoid is heading for Zuellni!

00:14:43.667 --> 00:14:44.875
Yeah.

00:14:47.875 --> 00:14:50.875
A contaminoid is headed for
Zuellni at high speed!

00:15:01.542 --> 00:15:04.000
The kei-ra cannon is ready to fire.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.833
Make sure the beam doesn't hit the buildings!

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:29.958
Zuellni...

00:15:29.958 --> 00:15:31.542
It's being destroyed.

00:15:31.542 --> 00:15:32.958
Yeah...

00:15:37.542 --> 00:15:40.833
I'm sorry. I'll come for you as
soon as I've dropped Nina off.

00:15:40.833 --> 00:15:42.833
Till then, stay somewhere safe.

00:15:42.833 --> 00:15:45.833
All right. Please take care of Nina.

00:15:45.833 --> 00:15:47.667
Yeah. I will.

00:15:49.958 --> 00:15:51.792
Bye-bye!

00:15:57.417 --> 00:16:02.875
Saya... You chose Layfon,
and he took hold of that destiny.

00:16:02.875 --> 00:16:04.708
Is that it?

00:16:21.917 --> 00:16:23.958
Can you fire the kei-ra cannon?

00:16:23.958 --> 00:16:27.542
Not only has the beast secured air
supremacy, it has overwhelming speed.

00:16:27.542 --> 00:16:30.000
It will be difficult for us to take a shot.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.958
Has there been no word from Glendan?

00:16:31.958 --> 00:16:35.292
It looks like they have
their hands full with the other one.

00:16:35.292 --> 00:16:38.125
Essentially, "Take care of it yourself."

00:16:38.125 --> 00:16:41.875
I've made my decision.
I'll order a city-wide evacuation.

00:16:41.875 --> 00:16:45.208
We've done enough. Holding out any longer

00:16:45.208 --> 00:16:47.167
will just result in more sacrifice.

00:16:47.167 --> 00:16:50.458
I'll appeal to Glendan to accept our refugees.

00:16:50.458 --> 00:16:52.917
Once evacuation is complete,
I'll detonate the central unit.

00:16:52.917 --> 00:16:55.625
That will take the contaminoid with me.

00:16:55.625 --> 00:16:58.958
One person dying in this city is plenty.

00:16:58.958 --> 00:17:01.792
Hey, dammit, don't get any stupid ideas.

00:17:03.042 --> 00:17:07.750
All citizens, this is an alert
to evacuate Zuellni. I repeat.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:10.833
All citizens, this is an
alert to evacuate Zuellni.

00:17:10.833 --> 00:17:13.542
All citizens evacuate?!

00:17:13.542 --> 00:17:14.792
As you've just heard,

00:17:14.792 --> 00:17:17.292
it's too dangerous to remain in Zuellni any longer.

00:17:17.292 --> 00:17:18.417
This is a joke, right?

00:17:18.417 --> 00:17:21.792
Have the land rollers and roaming buses
make transporting the sick a priority.

00:17:21.792 --> 00:17:26.042
Those who can walk, walk.
Glendan isn't that far away right now.

00:17:26.042 --> 00:17:28.583
Open all gates in five minutes.

00:17:28.583 --> 00:17:32.958
All students: I'm grateful for
everything you've done for Zuellni.

00:17:32.958 --> 00:17:34.583
That is all.

00:17:37.458 --> 00:17:40.375
If I'm going to slow everyone down, then just...

00:17:40.375 --> 00:17:42.417
That's enough of that talk.

00:17:42.417 --> 00:17:46.417
Even if you kick the bucket,
I'm going to drag you along with me.

00:17:46.417 --> 00:17:47.833
Brother...

00:17:49.292 --> 00:17:51.125
What is that?

00:17:51.958 --> 00:17:53.375
Fon-Fon.

00:17:54.708 --> 00:17:56.875
Lay-ton.

00:17:56.875 --> 00:17:58.708
Lay-ton is...

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:03.750
Where <i>is </i>Lay-ton?

00:18:10.667 --> 00:18:14.417
<i>Please... Let Layfon know his true power.</i>

00:18:18.917 --> 00:18:22.583
<i>That's it. That's it, Layfon.</i>

00:18:22.583 --> 00:18:25.583
<i>Take hold of your Heaven's Blade!</i>

00:18:38.167 --> 00:18:39.667
<i>Layfon...</i>

00:18:39.667 --> 00:18:42.708
Felli, tell me the area to
launch a pinpoint attack!

00:18:42.708 --> 00:18:44.333
All right.

00:18:45.667 --> 00:18:49.167
I have it. The area
above the base of the neck.

00:18:49.167 --> 00:18:53.417
It appears hard, but it's a
cluster of chemical synapses.

00:18:53.417 --> 00:18:54.833
Thank you.

00:19:01.667 --> 00:19:04.042
O sword... O Heaven's Blade!

00:19:04.042 --> 00:19:07.458
Give me all your power, <i>here</i>!

00:19:21.417 --> 00:19:23.000
Layfon!

00:19:24.042 --> 00:19:25.125
Prepare to fire!

00:19:25.125 --> 00:19:31.125
Five... Four... Three... Two... One...

00:19:31.125 --> 00:19:32.625
Fire!

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:35.958
Looks like someone stole the best part.

00:19:35.958 --> 00:19:38.125
We can't let just Layfon have all the fun.

00:19:38.125 --> 00:19:41.083
I'm finally outside. But, shit, I'm too late!

00:19:41.083 --> 00:19:45.042
You curse too much.
We'll take out ours with one shot, too.

00:19:45.042 --> 00:19:46.458
Yeah!

00:19:47.625 --> 00:19:49.792
Everyone, maximum kei output!

00:19:49.792 --> 00:19:51.208
Go!

00:20:04.875 --> 00:20:06.583
<i>Is it over?</i>

00:20:07.792 --> 00:20:13.708
Dainsleif. It's Ignacius's emissary,
sent from the Zero Realm

00:20:13.708 --> 00:20:16.042
to destroy the world of the Regios.

00:20:16.042 --> 00:20:17.125
Dick?

00:20:17.125 --> 00:20:21.542
So long as we fight in this world,
these guys will never die out.

00:20:22.792 --> 00:20:25.458
That means this is just the beginning.

00:20:25.458 --> 00:20:27.292
Well, see you.

00:20:29.958 --> 00:20:32.583
Glendan's moving away!

00:20:32.583 --> 00:20:36.083
I'm taking the Heaven's Blade.
You have no complaints?

00:20:36.083 --> 00:20:37.208
No, Sir.

00:20:37.208 --> 00:20:39.333
Um, what of Savalis-<i>san</i>?

00:20:39.333 --> 00:20:41.583
He's disappeared,
leaving only his Heaven's Blade...

00:20:41.583 --> 00:20:44.083
But, he'll be back soon.

00:20:44.083 --> 00:20:46.958
Oh, and we recovered Leerin.

00:20:46.958 --> 00:20:50.333
I see. Thank you very much.

00:20:50.333 --> 00:20:52.708
Do you have nothing to relay to her?

00:20:52.708 --> 00:20:56.917
Uh, no. Not especially.

00:20:56.917 --> 00:20:58.917
I see. Goodbye.

00:21:01.083 --> 00:21:03.542
Safe and sound, hmm? I'm glad.

00:21:03.542 --> 00:21:04.500
Huh?

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:09.500
Leerin. I'm glad she's safe and sound.

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:13.375
That tense situation was
just like a romance scene...

00:21:13.375 --> 00:21:14.792
...wasn't it?!

00:21:15.083 --> 00:21:17.500
Ow!!

00:21:37.625 --> 00:21:41.250
Why go to such lengths to protect this girl?

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:44.333
Because she could have been my daughter.

00:21:44.333 --> 00:21:45.417
What?

00:21:45.417 --> 00:21:48.958
If the cogs of fate had not gone awry, I mean.

00:21:48.958 --> 00:21:51.917
She was born to the
woman my fiancé ran away to.

00:21:51.917 --> 00:21:53.958
Born to the House of Euthonol?

00:21:53.958 --> 00:21:57.625
I wanted her to live the life of
a normal girl, if possible.

00:21:57.625 --> 00:22:01.917
But she chose this path on her own...

00:22:01.917 --> 00:22:04.583
The same way that Layfon did.

00:22:04.583 --> 00:22:07.000
You saw it, didn't you? That contaminoid.

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.208
So it was not of this world?

00:22:10.167 --> 00:22:12.708
This girl holds the key to fighting them

00:22:12.708 --> 00:22:15.125
in her right eye.

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:19.458
For now, just rest.

00:22:24.333 --> 00:22:28.750
<i>We live in the world of Regios.</i>

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:32.042
<i>Sometimes it is far from peaceful,</i>

00:22:32.042 --> 00:22:34.833
<i>and it may come with plenty of hardships...</i>

00:22:34.833 --> 00:22:38.958
<i>...but we can't run away.</i>

00:22:38.958 --> 00:22:43.792
<i>That's why I've decided to protect this world...</i>

00:22:45.042 --> 00:22:47.000
<i>...alongside my friends.</i>

00:23:00.792 --> 00:23:02.708
<i>I pray that one day...</i>

00:23:03.875 --> 00:23:09.042
<i>...I can be reunited with you, on Glendan soil.</i>

00:23:09.042 --> 00:23:10.667
<i>To Leerin Marfes.</i>

00:23:11.875 --> 00:23:14.042
<i>From Layfon Alseif.</i>

00:23:23.583 --> 00:23:25.500
"Dedicated to all who've loved Chrome Shelled
Regios and the memory of Tetsuya Koiso."

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:30.375
<i>Kizuite hoshii, kizukanaide</i>

00:23:30.375 --> 00:23:34.083
<i>Tsumetaku suru no wa koi no sei? </i>

00:23:34.083 --> 00:23:43.667
<i>Tsutaetai yo, soba ni ite yo, demo ienai</i>

00:23:44.458 --> 00:23:53.083
<i>Yogoreta kono sekai de anata ni deaeta yo</i>

00:23:53.083 --> 00:24:04.417
<i>Watashi no kokoro ni maiorita</i>
<i>kiseki kanadete kudasai</i>

00:24:04.417 --> 00:24:17.920
<i>Ai no Zuellni</i>
